  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, whisk together soy sauce, sake, sesame oil, and sugar.",
    "2. Add the chicken pieces to the marinade and mix well.",
    "3. Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes, or up to 2 hours.",
    "4. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "5. Thread the marinated chicken onto the skewers.",
    "6. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "7. Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "8. Garnish with green onions and serve immediately."
